OL,3,GNEWSAPart of the A14 closed after lorry
OL,4,Ahits bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A14 has been shut in
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire after a collision
OL,8,Finvolving two lorries, one of which
OL,9,Fstruck a bridge.
OL,11,FNational Highways said all traffic
OL,12,Fbetween junctions eight and nine, near
OL,13,FKettering, was being held.
OL,15,FAll emergency services have been called
OL,16,Fto the scene.
OL,18,F"Motorists are advised to avoid the
OL,19,Farea for the time being,"
OL,20,FNorthamptonshire Police said.
